WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.253
Week 36: Integrated Field Capstone. manage an unfamiliar situation brief and persuade reflect on strengths and a maintenance plan

2
00:00:09.253 --> 00:00:23.820
Operational objective. By the end of this section you can manage an unfamiliar situation, brief and persuade, reflect on strengths and a maintenance plan. The focus is useful performance, not isolated terminology.

3
00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:32.561
Language system. Integrated control of all course structures with accuracy prioritized according to communicative impact.

4
00:00:32.561 --> 00:00:42.496
Sound and delivery. Self-monitoring, strategic repair, intelligibility across a sustained interaction, and tolerance of regional variation.

5
00:00:42.496 --> 00:00:52.029
Core principle. Notice meaning first, then form. Retrieve the new language aloud, compare it with the model, and repair one feature at a time.

6
00:00:52.029 --> 00:01:30.852
Model language. Permítame aclarar lo que entendí. — Allow me to clarify what I understood. Antes de actuar, debemos comprobar la fuente. — Before acting, we must verify the source. Puedo resumir las dos posturas y justificar mi recomendación. — I can summarize both positions and justify my recommendation. Me adapto al registro sin imitar un acento. — I adapt to the register without imitating an accent. Mi plan de mantenimiento combina lectura, escucha, conversación y escritura. — My maintenance plan combines reading, listening, conversation, and writing.

7
00:01:30.852 --> 00:01:41.006
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
